                "pinyin": "w\u01d2men xi\u0101n z\u00e0i y\u012b su\u01d2 xu\u00e9xi\u00e0o j\u00ecnx\u00edng ji\u00e0oxu\u00e9 g\u01ceig\u00e9 de sh\u00ecdi\u01cen \uff0c b\u00ecng j\u00ecny\u012bb\u00f9 t\u016bigu\u01ceng d\u00e0o qu\u00e1nsh\u00ec de zh\u014dngxu\u00e9 \u3002",
                "en": "We first conducted a pilot reform of teaching in a school and further extended it to middle schools throughout the city."
